{"id":"n65096-1-9","stage":5,"title":"수발 · 服侍","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65096-1-9-1","ko":"남편이 팔을 다쳤다면서?","zh":"听说你丈夫胳膊受伤了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"남편이","meaning":"丈夫，老公","explanation":"남편：丈夫，老公；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"남편","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31919","senseId":"1","lemma":"남편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남편이","audio":"/audio/564d492c55e3e87b6a33.mp3"}},{"text":"팔을","meaning":"臂，胳膊","explanation":"팔：臂，胳膊；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"팔","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32794","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팔을","audio":"/audio/ab326ac2eb36fe9a1cc5.mp3"}},{"text":"다쳤다면서?","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다쳤다면서","audio":"/audio/b028cab89e870560c90f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a4e8e584126026d6","term":"남편","zh":"丈夫，老公","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3","entryId":"31919","definition":"夫妻关系中的男人。","pronunciation":["남편"]},{"id":"aab1afda0edcd3ae","term":"팔","zh":"臂，胳膊","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3","entryId":"32794","definition":"肩以下，手腕以上的部分。","pronunciation":["팔"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fc8109a5d4977cc3b962.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65096-1-9-2","ko":"응. 팔을 쓸 수 없는 상황이라 내가 식사 수발까지 들고 있어.","zh":"嗯，他现在胳膊不能用，连吃饭都得我照料。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"팔을","meaning":"臂，胳膊","explanation":"팔：臂，胳膊；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"팔","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32794","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팔을","audio":"/audio/ab326ac2eb36fe9a1cc5.mp3"}},{"text":"쓸","meaning":"动","explanation":"쓰다：动；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"8","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓸","audio":"/audio/fe874efc41706f784970.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"없는","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없는","audio":"/audio/9064a5c0bfdea4101ee3.mp3"}},{"text":"상황이라","meaning":"状况，情况","explanation":"상황：状况，情况；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"상황","audio":"/audio/946f8147acaaf499e924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16582","senseId":"1","lemma":"상황","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상황이라","audio":"/audio/498af52f011a1ad584f6.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"식사","meaning":"用餐，就餐，餐","explanation":"식사：用餐，就餐，餐","readings":[{"term":"식사","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29596","senseId":"1","lemma":"식사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식사","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3"}},{"text":"수발까지","meaning":"服侍，伺候","explanation":"수발：服侍，伺候；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"수발","audio":"/audio/51ba5094004c474de9c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65096","senseId":"1","lemma":"수발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수발까지","audio":"/audio/ed7d256f95af16977053.mp3"}},{"text":"들고","meaning":"做，服侍，伺侯","explanation":"들다：做，服侍，伺侯；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"28","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들고","audio":"/audio/3d6ddd0808b42a3e0c7e.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"aab1afda0edcd3ae","term":"팔","zh":"臂，胳膊","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3","entryId":"32794","definition":"肩以下，手腕以上的部分。","pronunciation":["팔"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"动","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"使用身体的某一部分。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"946f8147acaaf499","term":"상황","zh":"状况，情况","audio":"/audio/946f8147acaaf499e924.mp3","entryId":"16582","definition":"事情进行的景况或态势。","pronunciation":["상황"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"0f82e313dadba4d8","term":"식사","zh":"用餐，就餐，餐","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3","entryId":"29596","definition":"像早餐、午餐、晚餐那样每天在固定时间吃饭；或指那时吃的食物。","pronunciation":["식싸"]},{"id":"51ba5094004c474d","term":"수발","zh":"服侍，伺候","audio":"/audio/51ba5094004c474de9c6.mp3","entryId":"65096","definition":"在旁照料，供人使唤。","pronunciation":["수발"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"做，服侍，伺侯","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"为别人做什么事或采取什么行为。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f68c537678ff1875c1b4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.257,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65096","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":154,"sequenceScore":3.0837,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说你丈夫胳膊受伤了？","嗯，他现在胳膊不能用，连吃饭都得我照料。","最近新出的产品那么多，为什么还要买旧款呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说你丈夫胳膊受伤了？","嗯，他现在胳膊不能用，连吃饭都得我照料。","最近新出的产品那么多，为什么还要买旧款呢？"],"answer":1}]}
